	- business_id (INTEGER): Links to business_id in the businesses table.
	- score (INTEGER): Inspection score.
	- date (DATE): Date of the inspection.

3. violations:
	- business_id (INTEGER): Links to business_id in the businesses table.
	- date (DATE): Date of the violation.

